  <name>FinSnap</name>

  <description>Breakaway fins for parts printed standing on an edge. The fins hold the tilted part on the bed and touch it only with small horizontal tines, as a separate object or merged with the part. Printing on an edge puts the layers diagonal to the load and gives every side the same finish.</description>

